Package: detectiteasy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Determine types of files (Detect It Easy)
 Detect It Easy identifies file types, compilers, packers, and protectors.
 Provides die (GUI), diec (console), and diel (lite GUI), with the signature
 databases under /usr/lib/die, in the same layout as the author's package.
